DDIIAAGGNNOOSSTTIICCSS
     ddiiffff33 exits with status 0 if the collated differences were
     empty (the inputs describe no changes), 1 if they were not,
     and 2 if it could not open one of _g_e_n_e_r_a_t_o_raa or _g_e_n_e_r_a_t_o_rbb,
     or was given a bad argument.

