NNOOTTEESS
     The header comment in this program's source describes it ex-
     plicitly as ``the internal part of diff3'', meant to reside
     at /uussrr/lliibb/ddiiffff33 and be invoked as /uussrr/lliibb/ddiiffff33 [ooppttiioonnss]
     ggeenneerraattoorr after something else has run ddiiffff -ee twice to
     create _g_e_n_e_r_a_t_o_raa and _g_e_n_e_r_a_t_o_rbb.  This source tree installs
     the identical binary at both /bbiinn/ddiiffff33 and /uussrr/lliibb/ddiiffff33,
     but does not contain the front-end script (traditionally
     also called ddiiffff33) that would create the two intermediate
     difference files and invoke this program with a temporary-
     file generator name.  Consequently, running /bbiinn/ddiiffff33 with
     three file names, as the option summary above and the clas-
     sic ddiiffff33 command line suggest, does not work in this tree
     as built; it must be invoked with a single _g_e_n_e_r_a_t_o_r argu-
     ment naming an already-prepared pair of ddiiffff -ee output
     files.
